 {name:'The Forgotten Signal',label:'FORGOTTEN SIGNAL',tag:'A forest full of interrupted transmissions.',subtitle:'Radio Woods',terrain:'forest',symbol:'⌁',story:'Someone is sending scrambled messages from an abandoned communications tower. The first ten transmissions should reveal where the sender went.',finish:'The tower was an intentional decoy. The missing broadcasts point toward a remote canyon filled with ancient Guild symbols.'},
 {name:'Symbol Canyon',label:'SYMBOL CANYON',tag:'Ancient symbols. New secrets.',subtitle:'The Canyon Ruins',terrain:'desert',symbol:'◇',story:'The inscriptions are older than the network itself. A hidden message suggests that the Cipher Guild may have been blamed for someone else’s sabotage.',finish:'The canyon inscriptions reveal that ECHO has been safeguarding the network. The final truth is locked inside the mechanical Archives.'},
 {name:'The Clockwork Archives',label:'CLOCKWORK ARCHIVES',tag:'CLOCKWORK ARCHIVES',subtitle:'The Signal Engine',terrain:'archive',symbol:'⚙',story:'The machinery is still alive with pulses of coded light. Find the source of the tampered messages before the network goes permanently silent.',finish:'The final beacon is back online. ECHO was a protective system trying to warn the Guild, not an enemy. The network is restored.'}
